Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.94,0:13:25.02,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,来做个了断
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.31,0:13:27.16,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧！但是先要...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.38,0:13:30.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,等你摆脱了暗塌谷能量的控制！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.06,0:13:34.89,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.05,0:13:39.07,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.87,0:13:45.87,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.97,0:13:48.64,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,虾兵蟹将！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.12,0:13:50.94,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.55,0:13:52.54,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.91,0:13:53.90,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.78,0:14:05.00,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.99,0:14:14.33,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.10,0:14:21.46,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是Majesty！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.65,0:14:22.73,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,还没结束
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.95,0:14:27.80,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,吾才是... 最强！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.43,0:14:53.62,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 Majesty... 小空在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.66,0:15:00.67,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Majesty！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.26,0:15:07.41,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.45,0:15:12.49,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.95,0:15:18.35,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.28,0:15:33.02,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,奏效时间已经过了吗... 不过...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.01,0:15:39.40,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,Prism 你没受伤吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.51,0:15:45.38,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,（脚步声...）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.64,0:15:51.14,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,神威大典！请给予我们究极力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.43,0:15:53.28,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,神威大典 拜托了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.06,0:16:13.51,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才的是...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.70,0:16:16.66,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,“当Precure心连心 一条心之时”
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.83,0:16:19.92,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,“神威大典便会翻开 奇迹的篇章”
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.95,0:16:27.78,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,心连心...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.32,0:16:36.09,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙！把手放到大典上！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.86,0:16:49.70,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Wing！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.85,0:16:51.15,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢 你还好吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.46,0:16:54.20,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,还好... 大伙 手！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.72,0:17:06.99,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.15,0:17:10.52,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么？我们应该是一条心的！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.26,0:17:23.37,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,吾的... 胜利！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.32,0:17:36.24,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,神威大典 保护了我们？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.87,0:17:38.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,护盾裂了...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.07,0:17:41.07,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,连大典的力量都挡不住吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.31,0:17:42.84,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,都怪我！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.81,0:17:47.46,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我一直都不想让小空牵扯到战斗里来...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.10,0:17:51.20,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,所以神威大典的力量才没法觉醒！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.46,0:17:53.37,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,现在是说这种话的时候吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.58,0:17:55.74,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,继续下去 Majesty 还有我们...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.88,0:17:56.96,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道的！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.95,0:18:03.20,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.21,0:18:13.83,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.98,0:18:15.04,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Majesty！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.94,0:18:29.46,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.63,0:18:32.35,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,应该我来保护你的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.64,0:18:33.68,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.46,0:18:37.30,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,请相信小空的决心
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.52,0:18:38.85,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空的？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.99,0:18:42.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 小空她也会担心我们
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.77,0:18:44.84,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,想要保护我们的！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.61,0:18:47.17,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我是能够体会的...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.80,0:18:50.65,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,因为和那时候是一样的！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.67,0:18:57.02,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我不愿意真白同学受伤 哪怕是一根毫毛...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.43,0:19:01.95,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那个时候 真白同学是对我这么说的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.76,0:19:05.89,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,真白
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.67,0:19:11.29,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,我担心你 我想帮助你 我们心意相通
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.54,0:19:15.41,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,这还不足以作为一起战斗的理由吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.08,0:19:29.26,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,神威大典！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.97,0:19:40.66,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.79,0:19:57.40,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,神威大典！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.79,0:19:57.40,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Majesty Chronicon！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.88,0:20:27.19,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,起身飞向海阔天空的世界！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.78,0:20:55.90,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,光美！天威虹晕！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.78,0:20:55.90,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Precure！Majestic Halation！
