Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.62,0:21:05.23,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,豁然开朗
Dialogue: 1,0:21:02.62,0:21:05.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}豁然开朗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.07,0:21:14.42,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,所有的一切早已知晓...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.91,0:21:17.61,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,知识宫殿是不会有假的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.12,0:21:25.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我见识过了 天威虹晕
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.56,0:21:27.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我输了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.59,0:21:31.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让吾夺回武人之心的这份恩情
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.08,0:21:33.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定会报答你们的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.49,0:21:35.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后会有期 劲敌们！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.16,0:21:37.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弥诺彤彤！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.48,0:21:43.36,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,真是个自说自话的家伙 还有很多事情想问他的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.62,0:21:47.74,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,武人嘛 肯定有武人为人处世的方式
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.17,0:21:48.93,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.09,0:21:49.87,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.25,0:21:53.61,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,嘻嘻嘻... Prism 可喜欢你了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.82,0:21:55.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是的 Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.35,0:22:00.67,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,嘻嘻... 嘻嘻嘻...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.80,0:22:09.43,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我 Cure Majesty！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.80,0:22:09.43,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1075,970)}威爱愈卫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.97,0:22:13.23,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 要和我一起跳哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.53,0:23:49.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学 这本画书 是新作吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.40,0:23:50.05,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.20,0:23:51.47,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,画了很多呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.64,0:23:53.28,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我太喜欢画画了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.44,0:23:55.85,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 怎么了？公主
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.07,0:23:57.58,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,蚱蜢！蚱蜢！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.98,0:24:00.37,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.98,0:24:00.37,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海阔天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.37,0:24:03.17,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,蜢蜢！真白与归来的那个人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.27,0:01:18.48,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（冲上蓝天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.48,0:01:24.07,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 超越云巅
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.28,0:01:29.62,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飞吧！向着海阔天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.62,0:01:37.33,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空万里 美丽蓝天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.54,0:01:42.51,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨后初霁天空棱镜折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.76,0:01:46.71,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝天的景色预告着有好事发生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.71,0:01:48.22,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（蓝天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.22,0:01:52.51,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要确认一下 便伸直了双手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.10,0:01:57.10,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名为希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.19,0:01:59.06,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速紧握！紧紧握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.19,0:02:03.65,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,战胜绝望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.02,0:02:07.61,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.61,0:02:10.99,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦干眼泪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.64,0:02:10.99,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已经做好准备了吗）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.99,0:02:13.04,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飞跃而起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.40,0:02:13.04,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(让我们张开勇气之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.37,0:02:18.75,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 朝气蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.96,0:02:23.42,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把烦躁化为光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.67,0:02:28.72,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未来的图景 充满着可能
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.88,0:02:33.47,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,与在同一片蓝天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.85,0:02:36.27,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起唤起通向明日的奇迹！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.39,0:02:44.27,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海阔天空！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
